feat(tray): implement Win32 tray icon, settings window and auto-start per ADR-006

Implement Stage E6 (System tray, settings window and auto-start):
- Add Win32TrayIconService (ADR-006) using Shell_NotifyIconW, HWND_MESSAGE window, GetMessagePos and native CreatePopupMenu/TrackPopupMenuEx (Settings / Exit) without loading WinForms, keeping PrivateMemorySize64 at ~33.7 MB.
- Configure System.GC.ConserveMemory=5, RetainVMGarbageCollection=false and RenderMode.SoftwareOnly in App.xaml.cs to meet RNF-01 (< 50 MB) and Q-12 (< 46 MB).
- Add SettingsViewModel and SettingsWindow (MVVM) with immediate 300-500 ms grace period updates, auto-start toggle and ShutdownMode=OnExplicitShutdown for background operation.
- Add WindowsAutoStartService managing HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run.
- Update docs/plan/ESTADO.md to close E6 (464/464 tests passing, 33.71 MB avg RAM, 0.000% CPU).

Refs: RF02, HU05 (CA #1), §4.6-01, §4.6-03, E6-CA1..E6-CA5, RNF-01, RNF-02, ADR-006